    {
      "turn_id": "b1-p1-t3",
      "p": 1,
      "seq": 3,
      "title": "Learning the Gullet",
      "text": "Before you go down, you need to know what's waiting. A few regulars are still here, trapped like everyone else, and each of them has seen something.",
      "requires": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Buy the old drunk a drink and listen.",
          "roll": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "dc": 7
          },
          "success": {
            "text": "He tells you the mimic has three stomachs. Whatever shines ends up in the last one, and that is where Harold will be.",
            "effects": [
              {
                "type": "flag",
                "key": "map_known",
                "value": true,
                "scope": "world"
              }
            ],
            "goto": null
          },
          "fail": {
            "text": "He tells you about his divorce, at length. You learn a great deal, none of it about mimics.",
            "effects": [],
            "goto": null
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Map the chambers by listening to the mimic's rumbles.",
          "roll": {
            "skill": "perception",
            "dc": 9
          },
          "success": {
            "text": "Each rumble echoes from a different chamber. By the end you have a rough map. It smells faintly of onions.",
            "effects": [
              {
                "type": "flag",
                "key": "map_known",
                "value": true,
                "scope": "world"
              }
            ],
            "goto": null
          },
          "fail": {
            "text": "You have a drawing. It might be a map. It might be a duck.",
            "effects": [],
            "goto": null
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Skip the planning and trust your instincts.",
          "roll": null,
          "success": {
            "text": "Splurt looks at you with something like admiration. You hope it's deserved.",
            "effects": [
              {
                "type": "flag",
                "key": "no_plan",
                "value": true
              }
            ],
            "goto": null
          },
          "fail": {
